.TH FILEFORGE-SUGGEST 1 "FileForge 2.0"
.SH NAME
fileforge-suggest \- suggest conversions based on real files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fileforge-suggest
.RB [ --dir " DIR" ]
.RB [ --limit " N" ]
.RB [ --json ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
fileforge-suggest inspects files in a directory and suggests possible
conversions based on file types, extensions, and known workflows.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --dir " DIR"
Directory to inspect. Defaults to current directory.
.TP
.BR --limit " N"
Limit the number of suggestions.
.TP
.BR --json
Output suggestions as JSON.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B fileforge-suggest --dir . --limit 10
.br
Suggest up to 10 conversions for files in the current directory.
